<title>NETHERLANDS: ASM Litho wins Samsung order.</title>
<headline>ASM Litho wins Samsung order.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch ASM Lithography Holding NV said on Tuesday it had won a &quot;multi-million dollar&quot; follow-on order for its wafer stepper systems from South Korean semiconductor manufacturer Samsung Electronics.</p>
<p>ASM Lithography, a maker of equipment for the production of semiconductors, said the systems are scheduled for delivery in 1997.</p>
<p>The Dutch company set up a subsidiary in South Korea last year. ASML Korea Co Ltd will open a training centre this year and will add other local operations in the future, ASM Lithography said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
